  "body_text_excerpt": "Search COLORS PRODUCTS INSPIRATION VISUALIZER FIND A STORE BOOK A PAINTER ABOUT EMA PU PRIMER Solvent Based Ask about product PRODUCT DESCRIPTION Emirates Ema PU Primer is a quick-drying polyurethane primer designed for application on wood, masonry, steel, and other metal surfaces. RECOMMENDED USE This product is recommended for wood and masonry surfaces for polyurethane systems. It is also suitable for steel and other metals. Used for Industrial applications. Key Information Finish Matt Spreading Rate 12 - 15 m² / litre Dry Time Touch Dry: 1 - 2 hours Dry to Recoat: 6 - 8 hours Full Dry: 24 h",
